>Nah, you're not wrong. But does wishing for a rustproofed item work? It
>never has when I've tried, but I can't remember if the wish ever worked

Yes, you CAN wish for a rustproof item and it will work. But you have to be
careful to write the properties in the specific order. That is, 
first the blessed status, then the enchantments and then the rustproofing.
(Or was it the other way round after all.. :-?)
..and there are some items that won't rust but might burn, like speed boots.
When you wish for something like that, you should ask for fireproofing.
Or, you could just ask for corrodeproofing, and that works for both rust-
and fireproofing.
